{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026nfo8FJamPT1792990269.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產馬鞍山迎海御峰分行資深區域營業經理胡耀祖表示，近期樓市焦點落於一手，料月尾部份向隅客開始回流二手市場，馬鞍山聽濤雅苑本月錄約3宗成交，屋苑最新錄9座低層D室，實用面積748平方呎，3房連套房間隔，開價約938萬元，議價後以896萬元易手，實用平均呎價11,979元。</p><p><br/>中原胡耀祖指，新買家為換樓客，見單位間隔合用，價錢合理，即決定入市單位自用。據了解，原業主於2024年以940萬元購入單位，持貨約2年，是次轉手賬面上蝕44萬元或4.7%離場。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T08:41:13.322422+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":226,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T08:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T10:18:15.952115+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T08:38:09.527557+00:00","content_hash":"6015c128fa33f243bcbcd9b80e80554668ee2c030cbc0c2f51f806614db26136","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T08:41:13.322422+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}